  "system": {
    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>When you roll Initiative, you can regain all expended Focus Points. When you do so, roll your Martial Arts die, and regain a number of Hit Points equal to your Monk level plus the number rolled.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><section id=\"secret-KTgTyrtJJBs1nIDS\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Using this feature will restore all expended Focus Points and offers a Healing roll for restoring your Hit Points. It includes a single free use per Long Rest.</p></section>",
